{"slug":"surrey-council-reviews-new-costco-plan-oct-2025-8836736","path":"/blog.html/surrey-council-reviews-new-costco-plan-oct-2025-8836736","url":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/surrey-council-reviews-new-costco-plan-oct-2025-8836736","kind":"blog","title":"Surrey Council Reviews New Costco Plan – Oct 2025","canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/surrey-council-reviews-new-costco-plan-oct-2025-8836736","seo":{"Title":"Surrey Council Reviews New Costco Plan – Oct 2025","Meta description":"City of Surrey Council will consider a new Costco store proposal and 24th Avenue / Highway 99 interchange upgrades on October 20 2025. Learn more about these projects and local growth with Jared Gibbons.","H1":"Proposed Costco Development and 24th Avenue Interchange Upgrades Move Forward in South Surrey","Canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/surrey-council-reviews-new-costco-plan-oct-2025-8836736","Meta robots":"","OG title":"Proposed Costco Development and 24th Avenue Interchange Upgrades Move Forward in South Surrey","OG description":"City of Surrey Council will consider a new Costco store proposal and 24th Avenue / Highway 99 interchange upgrades on October 20 2025. Learn more about these projects and local growth with Jared Gibbons.","OG image":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/wps/rest/64736/blog/slwn/slwnybaqttmz.webp","Published":"2025-10-17T22:28:11+00:00","Modified":"2026-10-01T18:08:48+00:00"},"blocks":[{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"RSS","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.feed"}]},{"t":"h","level":1,"text":"Proposed Costco Development and 24th Avenue Interchange Upgrades Move Forward in South Surrey"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posted on"},{"t":"October 17, 2025"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/about.html"}],"cls":"byline"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"City of Surrey","h":"https://www.surrey.ca/"},{"t":"is advancing two major items for consideration at the"},{"t":"Council meeting on Monday, October 20, 2025"},{"t":"— a"},{"t":"proposed new Costco Wholesale Canada store in South Surrey"},{"t":"and planned"},{"t":"upgrades to the 24th Avenue interchange"},{"t":". Both projects demonstrate Surrey’s commitment to supporting continued"},{"t":"economic growth"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"transportation infrastructure"},{"t":"that meet the needs of residents and businesses."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"The first initiative centers on a"},{"t":"land-use application from"},{"t":"Costco Wholesale Canada","h":"https://www.costco.ca/"},{"t":"for a"},{"t":"second Costco location in"},{"t":"South Surrey","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/our-listings.html"},{"t":", a growing part of the region. The proposal will receive"},{"t":"first and second readings"},{"t":"as part of the Council’s"},{"t":"land-use agenda"},{"t":", before proceeding to a"},{"t":"public hearing"},{"t":"that will allow residents to share feedback. Mayor"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Brenda Locke"},{"t":"noted that the application reflects strong confidence from major employers investing in Surrey’s expanding economy."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Also under review is a corporate report detailing"},{"t":"planned improvements to the 24th Avenue overpass"},{"t":", developed jointly with the"},{"t":"Province of British Columbia","h":"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/home"},{"t":". The project includes"},{"t":"new access and egress to Highway 99"},{"t":", designed to"},{"t":"reduce congestion"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"enhance connectivity"},{"t":"throughout"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"South Surrey"},{"t":". Mayor Locke emphasized that by partnering closely with the Province, the City is advancing critical infrastructure that improves"},{"t":"traffic flow"},{"t":","},{"t":"safety"},{"t":", and"},{"t":"mobility"},{"t":"in one of Surrey’s key transportation corridors."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Together, these proposals mark a significant step in Surrey’s broader plan for"},{"t":"strategic growth"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"sustainable development"},{"t":". If approved, both projects will enhance the city’s livability and reinforce Surrey’s reputation as one of"},{"t":"B.C.’s leading economic centres"},{"t":"."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"📲"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Stay informed on Surrey’s latest development updates and real-estate trends with"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/contact.html"},{"t":"— your trusted resource for insights into local growth and investment opportunities."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Blogs"},{"t":"All Blog Posts","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"New Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86690"}],[{"t":"Open Houses","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86691"}],[{"t":"Real Estate Blog","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=82607"}],[{"t":"Sold Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86692"}]]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posts By Date"},{"t":"Most Recent","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"October 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/10/"}],[{"t":"September 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/09/"}],[{"t":"August 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/08/"}],[{"t":"July 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/07/"}],[{"t":"June 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/06/"}],[{"t":"May 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/05/"}],[{"t":"April 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/04/"}],[{"t":"March 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/03/"}],[{"t":"February 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/02/"}],[{"t":"January 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/01/"}],[{"t":"December 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/b